<!--
  English overrides for the cash-path result renderer (WM028-P). App defaults to
  Arabic; this file is applied when the user picks English in Settings.
  States render exactly as the model reports them: unknown is never zero, no FX,
  no fabricated headlines, no live-balance promises.
-->
